  "notes": "Third-party BatteryLife v12 copy of the Sandia (SNL) cycling data: the original BatteryArchive CSV files are not in Raw_Dataset. Each pickle carries its own materials, nominal capacity and voltage limits; the test conditions are encoded in the cell id. The delivered 61 cells span LFP (18), NCA (22) and NMC (21), with nominal Ah values 1.1 (18 cells), 2.88 (4), 3.2 (18), 2.7 (4), and 3.0 (17). The collection-level 1.1 Ah is a modal representative, not a shared capacity; use per-cell specifications. Delivered lower cutoffs are 2.0/2.5 V and upper cutoffs 3.6/4.2 V. The independent scan found 10,992,431 finite temperature values among 11,572,303 entries; presence does not imply complete coverage."
